# Route: guide 47 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 60, 54
# quests, 4.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring, Feralas, Arathi Highlands, Wetlands, Tanaris, Un'Goro
# Crater, The Barrens, Ironforge, Stormwind City, Blasted Lands, Badlands,
# Swamp of Sorrows, Redridge Mountains, Felwood): Everlook -> Frostfire Hot
# Springs -> Everlook -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Sardor Isle -> Ruins of
# Ravenwind -> Sardor Isle -> Frayfeather Highlands -> Sardor Isle -> Lower
# Wilds -> Circle of West Binding -> Thandol Span -> Refuge Pointe -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): High Chief Winterfall (5121; High
# Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59); It's
# Dangerous to Go Alone (3962; Blazerunner 56); Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26); An Ambassador of Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42); Morganth
# (249; Morganth 26).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Drakefire Amulet (6502), The Crone of the Kraul (1101),
# Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7482),
# Lethtendris's Web (7488), The Fury Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep
